  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which of the following expressions is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis sine 24 degree right parenthesis left parenthesis cosine 66 degree right parenthesis plus left parenthesis cosine 24 degree right parenthesis left parenthesis sine 66 degree right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mn>66</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mn>66</mn></mrow><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>",
